  <li>Extensions cannot access your filesystem outside of designated directories</li>
  <li>Network access is limited to domains declared in the extension manifest</li>
</ul>
<p>We review extensions published to The Nest but cannot guarantee they are free of bugs or unintended behavior. Install extensions at your own discretion.</p>

